{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-koko-replacement-pods","title":"Uwell Caliburn Koko Replacement Pods – 4 Pcs","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Uwell Caliburn KOKO Replacement Pods are designed for the Uwell Caliburn koko pod system Featuring a 2ml nic salt e-liquid capacity and an atomizer resistance of 1.2 ohm. Each KOKO re-fillable pod features a magnetic connection and fits smoothly into the housing. The housing that holds the pod in place has a side view window which allows users to casually check their juice level without removing the pod itself.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNote: The original Caliburn Replacement Pods are compatible with the KOKO device.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduct Specifications:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUwell Caliburn KOKO Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2ml E-Liquid Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRe-Fillable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3.5mm Fill Ports\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDual Ports\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.2 ohm Atomizer Resistance\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMinimum Fill Line\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGold Plated Contacts\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduct Includes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eOne Pack of Four (4) 1.2 ohm Caliburn Pod.","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531606859831,"sku":"U Cali Koko Replace Pods - 4 pcs","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Uwell-Caliburn-Koko-Replacement-Pods.jpg?v=1741702523","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-koko-replacement-pods","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




